__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Evidence photos must never be committed by accident. The negations below are
# the one exception: documentation screenshots live in docs/media/, and without
# them git would ignore every image you tried to add to the README.
*.jpg
*.png
!docs/media/*.png
!docs/media/*.jpg

# Video belongs on the GitHub release, not in the repository. A phone recording
# is tens of megabytes and git keeps it forever, in every clone, even after a
# later commit deletes it.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
